          "That is where my side begins. I am a registered advocate and a member of the Bar Council in India. I know how production units operate across the country, and I put every agreed quality standard into written Indian supplier contracts backed by mutual NDA and NNN agreements. Our division of labour stays plain: you focus on your business and your marketing, and leave manufacturing on the ground in India to us.",
